From 0a07f16d359814f1b7bdab0e910074e3bbde8a64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tanmay Varun <varuntanmay21@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:16:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): close SEARCH ranking abstraction leaks

Stop inventing originator/container from unordered evidence_tokens, drop
host denylist semantics from hypothesis ranking, keep commit_readiness out
of explore rank_key, make ACT consume SEARCH choice only, and mark unique
fit as provisional retrieval_complete.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
